{"path":"types/numeric_limits/digits","title":"std::numeric_limits<T>::digits","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::numeric_limits&lt;T&gt;::</span>digits","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/types/numeric_limits/digits","section":"types","kind":"page","summary":"The value of std::numeric_limits<T>::digits is the number of digits in base-radix that can be represented by the type T without change.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n</tbody>\n<tbody class=\"t-dcl-rev\">\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-until-cxx11\">\n<td><div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">static</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> digits<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> </td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx11\">(until C++11)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">static</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> digits<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>The value of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/numeric_limits\"><span class=\"kw351\">std::<span class=\"me2\">numeric_limits</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">digits</span></span></code> is the number of digits in base-<a href=\"/w/cpp/types/numeric_limits/radix\">radix</a> that can be represented by the type <code>T</code> without change. For integer types, this is the number of bits not counting the sign bit and the padding bits (if any). For floating-point types, this is the digits of the mantissa (for <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/numeric_limits/is_iec559\">IEC 559/IEEE 754</a> implementations, this is the number of digits stored for the mantissa plus one, because the mantissa has an implicit leading 1 and binary point).\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Standard_specializations\">Standard specializations</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td>  <code>T</code>\n</td>\n<td>  value of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/numeric_limits\"><span class=\"kw351\">std::<span class=\"me2\">numeric_limits</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">digits</span></span></code><br>(assuming no <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/object#Object_representation_and_value_representation\">padding bits</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"coMULTI\">/* non-specialized */</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>  <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">​<span class=\"nu0\">0</span>​</span></code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>  <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"nu0\">1</span></span></code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">char</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>  <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/climits\"><span class=\"kw393\">CHAR_BIT</span></a> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/numeric_limits\"><span class=\"kw351\">std::<span class=\"me2\">numeric_limits</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">is_signed</span></span></code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">signed</span